{
  "id": "pressure_ratings_of_pipes_and_fittings",
  "title": "Pressure Ratings of Pipes and Fittings",
  "description": "Pressure ratings of pipes and tubes and their fittings - carbon steel, stainless steel, plastic, copper and more.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Pressure Ratings of Pipes and Fittings\n\nThis calculator helps you determine the pressure ratings for various types of pipes and fittings used in mechanical, electrical, and plumbing systems.\n\n### Material Types\n- Carbon Steel\n- Stainless Steel\n- Plastic (PVC, CPVC, PEX)\n- Copper\n- Aluminum\n- Cast Iron\n\n### Standard Specifications\n- ANSI/ASME B16.5 (Flanges)\n- ANSI/ASME B16.11 (Forged Fittings)\n- ANSI/ASME B16.9 (Factory-Made Wrought Steel Buttwelding Fittings)\n- ASTM Standards\n- ISO Standards\n\n### Factors Affecting Pressure Ratings\n- Material composition\n- Pipe schedule and wall thickness\n- Operating temperature\n- Connection type (threaded, welded, flanged)\n- Safety factor"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "material_type",
          "label": "Material Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Carbon Steel",
              "value": "carbon_steel"
            },
            {
              "label": "Stainless Steel",
              "value": "stainless_steel"
            },
            {
              "label": "Plastic (PVC)",
              "value": "plastic_pvc"
            },
            {
              "label": "Copper",
              "value": "copper"
            },
            {
              "label": "Aluminum",
              "value": "aluminum"
            },
            {
              "label": "Cast Iron",
              "value": "cast_iron"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "pipe_diameter",
          "label": "Pipe Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "pipe_schedule",
          "label": "Pipe Schedule",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "SCH 10",
              "value": 10
            },
            {
              "label": "SCH 20",
              "value": 20
            },
            {
              "label": "SCH 30",
              "value": 30
            },
            {
              "label": "SCH 40",
              "value": 40
            },
            {
              "label": "SCH 60",
              "value": 60
            },
            {
              "label": "SCH 80",
              "value": 80
            },
            {
              "label": "SCH 120",
              "value": 120
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "operating_temperature",
          "label": "Operating Temperature",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°F",
          "defaultValue": 68
        },
        {
          "id": "safety_factor",
          "label": "Safety Factor",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 4,
          "unit": ""
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "pressure_rating",
          "label": "Pressure Rating",
          "unit": "PSI",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.pipe_schedule * inputs.safety_factor * (100 - inputs.operating_temperature / 10) / 100"
        },
        {
          "id": "recommended_operating_pressure",
          "label": "Recommended Operating Pressure",
          "unit": "PSI",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.pressure_rating * 0.6"
        },
        {
          "id": "burst_pressure",
          "label": "Burst Pressure (Estimated)",
          "unit": "PSI",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.pressure_rating * 3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Material Type",
        "Temperature Range (°F)",
        "Common Schedules",
        "Max PSI (1\" Pipe)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Carbon Steel",
          "-20 to 650",
          "SCH 40, SCH 80",
          "1440"
        ],
        [
          "Stainless Steel",
          "-320 to 800",
          "SCH 10, SCH 40, SCH 80",
          "2160"
        ],
        [
          "Plastic (PVC)",
          "32 to 140",
          "SCH 40, SCH 80",
          "600"
        ],
        [
          "Copper",
          "-100 to 400",
          "Type K, L, M",
          "2800"
        ],
        [
          "Aluminum",
          "-100 to 350",
          "SCH 40",
          "1100"
        ],
        [
          "Cast Iron",
          "32 to 366",
          "Class 125, 250",
          "200"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}